abstract: >-
  Fixed, optionally learnable, high-pass SRM / residual filter banks for PyTorch: the standard
  noise-residual front end in steganalysis and image forensics, as named, cited and tested
  kernel banks (Fridrich & Kodovsky 2012; Zhou et al. 2018).
